Vid Borić, witness at Brinje house 132||witness to the baptism of Radotić Luce, of Brinje - not in the tree|witness at a baptism|30 May 1894|Brinje, Croatia|FamilySearch, Croatia Church Books 1516-1994, Brinje Matična knjiga rođenih 1893-1897 (DGS 005498262, waypoint 9R26-82S), image 251, entry no. 46 - the baptism of "RADOTIĆ LUCE", female, of Brinje house 132, daughter of Radotić Tome and Mesić Marija, names "BORIĆ VID" as a witness alongside Radotić Luce (an adult of the same name as the child, not a duplicate entry). NOT IN THE TREE. A plausible, unconfirmed match for the Vid Borić already in this file (married 1890, son of Luka Borić, Kamenica house 17) - the given name is distinctive, but that earlier entry's own given name was itself a hard-to-read guess, not a confident transcription, so this link is tentative on both ends. No document names them as the same man.
