Kate Borić, unmarried mother, of Kamenica||unmarried mother of Ove Borić, of Kamenica house 3 - not in the tree|birth of a child|3 July 1894|Kamenica, Brinje parish, Croatia|FamilySearch, Croatia Church Books 1516-1994, Brinje Matična knjiga rođenih 1893-1897 (DGS 005498262, waypoint 9R26-82S), image 254, entry no. 57 - "BORIĆ OVE", female, of Kamenica house 3, father's column left blank, daughter of "BORIĆ KATE" alone - the child takes her unmarried mother's surname. NOT IN THE TREE. A second unmarried Borić mother in this file (after Luce Borić of Kamenica, this file, whose son Marko was born in 1891) - kept separate, since nothing ties the two Kamenica women together beyond the pattern itself. A new Kamenica house number (3) for the surname.
