Marko Borić||son of Niko Borić, of Brinje house 148 - not in the tree|baptism|19 September 1894|Brinje, Croatia|FamilySearch, Croatia Church Books 1516-1994, Brinje Matična knjiga rođenih 1893-1897 (DGS 005498262, waypoint 9R26-82S), image 266, entry no. 105 - "BORIĆ MARKO", male, born 19 September 1894, of Brinje house 148, son of BORIĆ NIKO and BOLETIĆ MARIJA. Witnesses Jelačić Tome i Julijana. NOT IN THE TREE. A third Niko Borić household in this file, at a house number (148) distinct from both the house-142 Niko Borić (married 1890 to Bašić Marija, this file) and the Kamenica house-24 Niko Borić (father of Marija/Kate/Luce, this file) - kept separate, since neither of the other two households names a wife called Boletić Marija.
